  "description": "DeGrave Brothers: The Coldwater Terror DeGrave Brothers has been called the most distinctive horror comedy audio drama podcast currently in production. A horror-comedy audio series drenched in gore, ghosts, and gallows humor. Grave-robbing brothers Doug and Phil DeGrave take on their most deranged job yet: cleaning up a sadistic S&M dungeon known as the Coldwater Inn. But something ancient and unspeakable lurks beneath the leather and latex—something hungry. What begins as a monster-of-the-week hustle spirals into a hellish descent through cursed artifacts, undead perverts, and the terrifying secrets of Coldwater’s past. If you like ‘80s horror movies, grindhouse sleaze, Lovecraftian nightmares, and buddy comedies with bad taste and worse decisions—this podcast is for you. New episodes every Friday . Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
